{"id":"input-eb1ac405d413","steamAppId":"934700","name":"Dead Island 2","imageUrl":"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/934700/library_600x900.jpg","steamUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/934700/","genres":["Action","Adventure"],"platforms":["windows","mac"],"controllerSupport":"full","playerModes":{"singlePlayer":true,"multiplayer":true,"coop":true,"localCoop":false,"sharedOrSplitScreen":false,"onlineCoop":true,"maximumPlayers":null},"storage":{"windowsMinimumGB":70.0,"windowsMinimumDisplay":"70 GB"},"verificationStatus":"identified","supportsVietnamese":false,"vietnameseSupportStatus":"not_listed","steamTags":["Co-op","Zombies","Gore","First-Person","Action-Adventure","Post-apocalyptic","Horror","Adventure","Action RPG","Dark","Crafting","FPS","Controller","Dark Humor","Action","PvE","Character Customization","Combat","Hack and Slash","Multiplayer"],"sourceProfile":{"shortDescription":"A deadly virus is spreading across Los Angeles, turning its inhabitants into zombies. Bitten, infected, but more than just immune, uncover the truth behind the outbreak and discover who - or what - you are. Survive, evolve and become the ultimate Zombie Slayer.","developers":["Dambuster Studios"]},"content":{"status":"success","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T09:54:30.799917+00:00","identityStatus":"verified","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","shortDescription":"A deadly virus is spreading across Los Angeles, turning its inhabitants into zombies. Bitten, infected, but more than just immune, uncover the truth behind the outbreak and discover who - or what - you are. Survive, evolve and become the ultimate Zombie Slayer.","detailedDescription":"For customers in Germany - Once zombies are defeated, players can no longer deal damage to or further dismember zombie corpses. USK players can play co-op sessions with international players through friend invites and joining friends. For public matchmaking, USK players can only play with other USK players."},"vi":{"status":"translated","shortDescription":"Một loại virus chết người đang lây lan khắp Los Angeles, biến cư dân thành thây ma. Bị cắn, bị nhiễm, nhưng không chỉ miễn dịch, khám phá ra sự thật đằng sau sự bùng phát và khám phá ra bạn là ai hay bạn là ai. Sống sót, tiến hóa và trở thành thây ma cuối cùng.","detailedDescription":"Đối với khách hàng ở Đức - một khi thây ma bị đánh bại, người chơi không còn có thể gây thiệt hại cho xác sống hoặc bị chặt thêm nữa. Người chơi Mỹ có thể chơi chung với cầu thủ quốc tế thông qua mời bạn bè và gia nhập bạn bè. Để mai mối công khai, người chơi USK chỉ có thể chơi với các cầu thủ khác của USK."}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/934700/header.jpg?t=1790170542"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/934700/a247bbfb249b71dfed4d6e582e5bea2b1dbd4358/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1790170542"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/934700/ss_d0ac6f8e16e69a331d848b879f6a2384f4cd8acd.600x338.jpg?t=1790170542","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/934700/ss_d0ac6f8e16e69a331d848b879f6a2384f4cd8acd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790170542"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/934700/ss_480f620579dbf5514834cea9db59b1ccfb8de8d3.600x338.jpg?t=1790170542","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/934700/ss_480f620579dbf5514834cea9db59b1ccfb8de8d3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790170542"},{"id":2,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/934700/ss_e026a2f2800af5cef892b1677f028ee47bc97426.600x338.jpg?t=1790170542","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/934700/ss_e026a2f2800af5cef892b1677f028ee47bc97426.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790170542"},{"id":3,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c